    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>The reclusive Nosferatu Memnon, called \"king\" by his own Clan and rumored to be a Methuselah, may be Marseille's true secret power, playing every faction &mdash; the Sabbat, the Giovanni, the Setites &mdash; against the others to keep the city locked in permanent, useful chaos. His true age and origins are unknown even to most of his own clan.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Speak in riddles and half-truths. You know secrets about everyone in Marseille and let each faction believe you favor them alone.</p>",
    "notes": "Rumored Methuselah; true power behind Marseille's factional chaos, manipulating the Sabbat, Giovanni, and Setites against one another.",
